# Build output, generated files and caches: every project's bin/ and obj/ (the generated @spar/app client, the test
# results), and the frontend's installed packages. The contract snapshot (MyApp/MyApp.contracts.snapshot) and the
# frontend's package-lock.json are committed.
bin/
obj/
node_modules/

# Editors' per-user files, and the empty results folder Visual Studio's Test Explorer creates beside the solution (the
# tests' results go to each test project's obj/test-results/).
.vs/
*.user
/TestResults/
